<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Przerwa techniczna – Lekcje Pianina Gdynia</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--gold:#d4af37;--navy:#1e3a8a;--navy-deep:#0f1e4a;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 140% at 50% -10%, #24408f 0%, var(--navy) 45%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color:white;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height:100vh;
    padding:32px 20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    position:relative;
  }

  /* pływające nuty w tle */
  .note{position:absolute;color:rgba(212,175,55,0.16);font-size:2.4rem;pointer-events:none;animation:drift 9s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .note:nth-child(1){top:14%;left:8%;font-size:2rem;animation-duration:10s;}
  .note:nth-child(2){top:70%;left:12%;font-size:3.2rem;animation-duration:12s;animation-delay:1s;}
  .note:nth-child(3){top:20%;right:10%;font-size:2.6rem;animation-duration:11s;animation-delay:0.5s;}
  .note:nth-child(4){top:75%;right:14%;font-size:1.8rem;animation-duration:8s;animation-delay:2s;}
  @keyframes drift{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);}50%{transform:translateY(-22px) rotate(6deg);}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.note{animation:none;}}

  .card{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    max-width:520px;
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-block;
    background:rgba(212,175,55,0.14);
    border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:0.72rem;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:7px 18px;
    border-radius:50px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }

  h1{
    font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
    font-size:clamp(1.9rem,5.5vw,2.9rem);
    line-height:1.2;
    margin:0 0 16px;
    color:white;
  }
  h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold);}

  p.sub{
    font-size:0.98rem;
    line-height:1.75;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
    max-width:420px;
    margin:0 auto 40px;
  }

  /* sygnaturowy element: strojone pianino */
  .keys{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:3px;
    margin:0 auto 44px;
    height:78px;
    align-items:flex-end;
  }
  .key{
    width:15px;
    height:64px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    animation:press 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .key:nth-child(1){animation-delay:0s;}
  .key:nth-child(2){animation-delay:0.15s;background:#12162a;height:42px;margin:0 -9px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .key:nth-child(3){animation-delay:0.3s;}
  .key:nth-child(4){animation-delay:0.45s;background:#12162a;height:42px;margin:0 -9px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .key:nth-child(5){animation-delay:0.6s;}
  .key:nth-child(6){animation-delay:0.75s;}
  .key:nth-child(7){animation-delay:0.9s;background:#12162a;height:42px;margin:0 -9px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .key:nth-child(8){animation-delay:1.05s;}
  .key:nth-child(9){animation-delay:1.2s;background:#12162a;height:42px;margin:0 -9px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  @keyframes press{
    0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);filter:brightness(1);}
    50%{transform:translateY(6px);filter:brightness(0.85);}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.key{animation:none;}}

  .contact-box{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:26px 28px;
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  }
  .contact-box p{
    font-size:0.8rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    margin:0 0 14px;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .contact-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
  .contact-links a{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:10px;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:white;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    border-radius:50px;
    padding:12px 20px;
    transition:0.25s;
  }
  .contact-links a:hover{
    background:var(--gold);
    color:var(--navy);
    border-color:var(--gold);
    transform:translateY(-2px);
  }

  .footer-note{
    margin-top:28px;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <span class="note" aria-hidden="true">♪</span>
  <span class="note" aria-hidden="true">♫</span>
  <span class="note" aria-hidden="true">♩</span>
  <span class="note" aria-hidden="true">♬</span>

  <div class="card">
    <span class="eyebrow">Przerwa techniczna</span>

    <div class="keys" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div>
      <div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div>
      <div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div><div class="key"></div>
    </div>

    <h1>Strona nabiera <em>nowego brzmienia</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">Pracujemy nad ulepszeniami i zaraz wracamy do gry. W pilnych sprawach — np. rezerwacji terminu — napisz lub zadzwoń bezpośrednio.</p>

    <div class="contact-box">
      <p>Kontakt bezpośredni</p>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="tel:514338875">📞 514 338 875</a>
        <a href="mailto:lukaszgkorepetycje@gmail.com">✉️ lukaszgkorepetycje@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="footer-note">Łukasz Ganczarek · Lekcje Pianina Gdynia</p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
